Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://blessingmwiti.com

Package: faah
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, mpg123
Description: play the bundled faah sound
 faah is a tiny command-line wrapper that plays the short "faah" audio
 clip shipped in this package.  It does not decode audio itself; it
 uses an installed player, preferring mpg123 and falling back to
 mpg321, ffplay, mpv, cvlc, gst-play, mplayer, sox or afplay.
 .
 It is a single, dependency-light script intended for people who want
 the clip available from any terminal.
